OL,3,GNEWSAMum wants free school bus to help
OL,4,Ason's independence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parent is campaigning to reinstate a
OL,7,Ffree school bus to give her child and
OL,8,Fothers more independence.
OL,10,FHilary's son, River, is due to start at
OL,11,FClaydon High School, near Ipswich, and
OL,12,Fwants the bus from their home in
OL,13,FBramford to be free instead of the
OL,14,F#3-a-day fare.
OL,16,FThe free bus was stopped in 2019, but
OL,17,FHilary says it should be brought back
OL,18,Fbecause there is no safe route from
OL,19,FBramford to Claydon for children to
OL,20,Fwalk or cycle.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
